   399	## 6. The surviving cell (3,2)
   400	
   401	### 6.1 Rigid structure forced by the leading forms
   402	
   403	`beta=2` gives `L_2=0` and `g_{-2}=E_2(V^2)+V L_1(V^2) != 0`. `alpha=3` gives
   404	`f_{-3}=V D_2(V^2)` odd and nonzero. With `gcd(3,2)=1`, (4.1) reads
   405	
   406	```text
   407	f_{-3}=c_1 h^3,      g_{-2}=c_2 h^2,      c_1 c_2 != 0,
   408	```
