   421	square and `D_2` is `Z` times a cube; and in particular `Z` divides both. The
   422	relation `Z D_2^2 = mu E_2^3` is the exact "second-order invariant" for this
   423	cell -- it is the resultant-free integrated form of the leading system and it
   424	is not absorbable, because there is no level-3 datum.
