+
+**Verdict: PROMOTE.** Let `f=phi(Z)` and `g=R_0+US_0`. The odd equation is
+`O=-4phi_Z(R_0)_A`. If `phi_Z=0`, the bracket vanishes; otherwise the domain
+property forces `R_0=r(Z)`. The even equation then is
+
+```text
