+`E_2=L_1=L_2=0` and `g_-1=E_1(V^2)+VL_0(V^2)` (`r2:321-329`). In cell `(3,1)`,
+the leading equation gives `f_-3=c k^3`, `k=g_-1`; oddness of `f_-3` forces
