+4. **Degree-list and vanished-leader bugs.** The SPEC-1 cap `k<=8` cannot hold
+   `D_2=c_1Zeta^3` when `deg eta=3`, whose degree can be ten
+   (`r2:568,583-587`). “`deg_A<=2`” must actually zero every higher template
