+   a fixed-`N` solution, or one retaining the terminal `(3,2)` relations
+   (`r2:630-633`). A valid finite-jet control, independent of those relations,
+   is
+
+   ```text
+   kappa=2,  f=Z,
+   g=U(-1+(2/3)AZ-(8/15)A^2Z^2+(16/35)A^3Z^3).
+   ```
