+This returns `{A,U}=2A^2` and
+`{U,Z}=4V^2/T-2=2+4AZ`, so both advertised generator controls are exact
+(`r2:92-104`) and agree with the independently reviewed bracket
+(`theta:51-79`; `prior:24-68`).
