+          +Z(8D_1E_2'+12D_2E_1'-8D_1'E_2-4D_2'E_1).
+```
+
+Put `F=D_1-D_2'`, `G=E_1-E_2'`. Substitution of the leading forms reduces
+this to `2 Z eta` times
